From: Virgo Android 14 port <virgo-port@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] lineage-sdk: match Android 14 user-switch observer API

Android 14's IUserSwitchObserver.onBeforeUserSwitching() accepts only the new
user ID. The old Lineage SDK implementation still declared the removed reply
argument, so javac rejected the @Override and left the Binder stub incomplete.
Keep the asynchronous reply callback on onUserSwitching(), where Android 14
still defines it, and update only the before-switch signature.

--- a/lineage/lib/main/java/org/lineageos/platform/internal/common/UserContentObserver.java
+++ b/lineage/lib/main/java/org/lineageos/platform/internal/common/UserContentObserver.java
@@ -35,6 +35,6 @@ public abstract class UserContentObserver extends ContentObserver {
     private IUserSwitchObserver mUserSwitchObserver = new IUserSwitchObserver.Stub() {
         @Override
-        public void onBeforeUserSwitching(int newUserId, IRemoteCallback reply)
+        public void onBeforeUserSwitching(int newUserId)
                 throws RemoteException {
         }
         @Override
